  "known_problems": [
    "LICENCE CONFLICT: this build links libzvbi, whose src/packet-830.c and src/pdc.c are GPL-2.0-only, into avcodec-62.dll, a GPL-3.0-or-later build. A source bundle does not cure that. Upstream confirmed it (FFmpeg-Builds issue 694) and stopped building zvbi into GPL builds in commit 162691525a439dbec17f5d01a8d241f134b7516d on 2026-11-07. Pin a build made after that commit before publishing.",
    "The Docker images the build ran in were deleted from the registry, so a bit-for-bit rebuild is not possible; the same scripts with fresh images rebuild it.",
    "rav1e's crates were fetched during the image build after 'cargo update cc'; the cc version used (build-time only) is not recorded."
  ]
